<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's H1 oil products exports up 60.8 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's H1 oil products exports up 60.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's petroleum products exports surged 60.8 percent to 107.6 million barrels in the first half of this year from 66.9 million a year before, the Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The ministry said oil products imports fell 26.2 percent to 96.7 million barrels in the first half against 131.0 million barrels a year earlier.</p>
<p>The ministry said a rise in domestic oil products output and a sharp slowdown in demand growth contributed to the rising exports.</p>
<p>The ministry did not give a breakdown by product.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
